- Snapshot Records have no trigger attributes (Failed, Confirmed, Update yes/no)
- Each DTC can have a different number of Snapshot Records stored (DemMaxNumberFreezeFrameRecords =: n)
- At each DTC, the Snapshot Record Numbers must be 1..n, without gaps.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='zh-HANS' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</DESC>
